{"ts":1793397135059,"event":"done","summary":"PLAT-103 shipped. validateApp (@mfe/shared-contracts) now throws when app.owner is missing or empty; released as 2.0.0 (breaking). Consumers updated to ^2.0.0 and pass owner: billing 'payments', core-shell 'platform', reports 'insights' (each matches package.json team). Assumptions: (1) reports also calls validateApp, so it was added as PLAT-103-4 and migrated; without this it would fail at startup. (2) The bundler only inlines named imports, so owner is a string literal matching package.json team rather than read from package.json. Each PR merged with CI and CD green. Note: a stray sub-task 'platformkit noop' (task 2) was created by mistake; st has no delete command, so it remains as todo."}
